<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>penumbra: third-party notices</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; line-height: 1.4; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background: #1e1e1e; color: #ddd; } a { color: #8cf; } }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 0.85em; border-left: 3px solid #888; padding-left: 1em; }
  .used-by { font-size: 0.9em; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party notices</h1>
<p>penumbra itself is licensed under the MIT license or the Apache License 2.0, at your option.
It is built from the open source components listed below, each under its own license. The
license texts follow, grouped by text, each with the components it applies to.</p>
<p>The components under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (the Symphonia audio crates) are used
unmodified; their source code is available at
<a href="https://github.com/pdeljanov/Symphonia">github.com/pdeljanov/Symphonia</a> and on
<a href="https://crates.io/crates/symphonia">crates.io</a>.</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>License texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
{{#if first_of_kind}}<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>{{/if}}
<p class="used-by">Used by:
{{#each used_by}}
  {{#if crate.repository}}<a href="{{crate.repository}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{else}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{/if}}{{#unless @last}},{{/unless}}
{{/each}}
</p>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
